@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR002: Manage Anomaly Detection Alerts" as SAFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Receive Personalized Recommendations" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Manage Recommendation Preferences" as CFR005
  usecase "SAFR006: Set Spending Limit Alerts" as SAFR006
  usecase "CFR007: View Investment Opportunities" as CFR007
  usecase "CFR008: Access News Related to Portfolio" as CFR008
  usecase "CFR009: Manage Relationship with Advisors" as CFR009

  usecase "FAFR001: Schedule Client Mentoring Sessions" as FAFR001
  usecase "SAFR003: View Intervention Alerts for Clients" as SAFR003
  usecase "FAFR002: Review Predictive Analytics on Clients" as FAFR002

  usecase "SFR004: Request Personalized Recommendations from AI" as SFR004
  usecase "AIFR001: Generate Financial Predictions" as AIFR001
  usecase "CFR011: Send Feedback to System" as CFR011

  Client --> CFR001 : View financial data and insights.
  SysAdmin -> SAFR002 : Manage system parameters for anomaly detection alerts.

  // Financial Advisor interactions
  FAFR001 -->> SFR039 : Schedule mentoring sessions with clients.
  FAFR002 -->> AIFR008 : Review predictive intervention recommendations from AI.
  
  Client --> CFR004 : Receive personalized financial advice based on profile.

  // System to AI interactions
  SysAdmin -> SAFR001 : Manage analysis parameters for the system's algorithms.
  SFR003 -->> AIFR002 : Request predictions via AI component.
  SFR006 -->> AIFR004 : Set spending limit alerts using data from client.

  // Client to System interactions
  Client --> CFR005 : Adjust personalization settings for recommendations.
  
  // User feedback loop
  SysAdmin -> SAFR019 : Track user insights history and trends.
  Client -->> SFR020 : Provide system with feedback on outputs.

@enduml